---
---

<section id="pricing" class="section">
  <div class="container-wide py-20 lg:py-28">
    <div class="max-w-2xl">
      <p class="kicker reveal"><span class="idx">06</span> — pricing</p>
      <h2 class="display-2 mt-5 reveal reveal-1">
        Pricing plans are being <span class="accent-text">finalised</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted reveal reveal-2">
        We're crafting fair, transparent tiers that scale from individual
        developers to enterprise platforms. Prices will be published soon.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 reveal reveal-2">
      <div class="tile mx-auto max-w-lg p-10 text-center">
        <span class="inline-flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-zinc-200 bg-zinc-50 dark:border-zinc-800 dark:bg-zinc-900">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-6 w-6 text-accent">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
            <path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/>
          </svg>
        </span>
        <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-medium tracking-tight">Coming Soon</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
          We're finalising pricing that works for developers, teams, and
          platforms. In the meantime, all connected data sources are
          available for free during the beta.
        </p>
        <a href="#cta" class="btn btn-primary mt-7">Join the waitlist</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
